  "notes": [
    "Attempts 0..3 (MAX_RETRIES=3 → 4 total); delay before retry attempt n = 500 * 2^(n-1) ms → 500, 1000, 2000. Retry on 5xx, 429 and network errors; every other 4xx throws immediately with `Ingest API error <status>: <body>`.",
    "The body is built ONCE per send(): identical bytes (same messageIds) on every retry — the server is at-least-once with no dedupe.",
    "Web drops the batch after exhaustion (outcome 'exhausted'); mobile SDKs deliberately RELEASE the reserved rows for a later flush instead — the classification (which statuses retry) is the contract, not the post-exhaustion policy.",
    "headers is the complete header set — no X-FP-Cookie/X-FP-Reset on mobile. keepalive/credentials are browser fetch() options with no mobile equivalent.",
    "Envelope sentAt is TRANSMISSION time (per-event sentAt stays creation time); ingest currently ignores the envelope sentAt."
  ],
